  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"217\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• About our brand and products 🌸🇫🇷</span></h3><p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"620\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Lili Margo is a French skincare brand born from a family passion for wellness and beauty. Our formulas feature over <strong data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"361\">240 natural ingredients</strong> 🌿 including iconic flowers like <strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"403\">lily</strong>, <strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"414\">daisy</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"432\">hibiscus</strong>. Thanks to our exclusive <strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"475\">Floractiv20+™</strong> patent and breakthrough tech like <strong data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"523\">SK•IN GEN</strong>, we blend <strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"556\">science and nature</strong> to create effective, sensorial skincare for all skin types 💧✨.</span></p><hr data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"625\"><h3 data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"661\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• What makes us different 🌟</span></h3><ul data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"1070\"><li data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"740\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"740\">🔬 <strong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"692\">Scientific innovation</strong>: patented Floractiv20+ &amp; SK•IN GEN nanofibers</p></li><li data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"827\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"827\">🌱 <strong data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"783\">95–99% natural origin ingredients</strong>, free from 123 controversial substances ❌</p></li><li data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"889\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"889\">🧴 <strong data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"851\">Made in France</strong> with ethical &amp; eco-conscious values</p></li><li data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"970\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"970\">🌍 <strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"926\">Committed to sustainability</strong>: recycling, reforestation, ocean clean-up</p></li><li data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1070\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1070\">🧖‍♀️ <strong data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"998\">Expert routines</strong> for every skin concern: aging, glow, blemishes, hydration, pollution...</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1075\"><h3 data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1111\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• How affiliates can earn 💸</span></h3><p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1195\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Earn generous commissions on every sale via your unique referral link 🛍️. Enjoy:</span></p><ul data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1326\"><li data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1233\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1233\">📊 Real-time performance tracking</p></li><li data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1280\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1280\">🎁 Exclusive bonuses based on sales volume</p></li><li data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1326\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1326\">🧰 Access to ready-to-use content &amp; visuals</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1331\"><h3 data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1361\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• How to promote us 📲</span></h3><ul data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1632\"><li data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1418\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1418\">📸 Share authentic routines, try-ons &amp; before/afters</p></li><li data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1480\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1480\">🤳 Create stories, reels &amp; unboxing with product textures</p></li><li data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1574\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1574\">💬 Use discount codes &amp; ingredient spotlights (think: daisy 🌼, hibiscus 🌺, collagen 💎)</p></li><li data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1632\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1632\">🫶 Speak to a community that loves clean, radiant skin!</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1637\"><h3 data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1667\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Other information ℹ️</span></h3><ul data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1889\"><li data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1741\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1741\">🌐 Shop available worldwide at <a data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1739\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" href=\"https://lilimargo.com\">lilimargo.com</a></p></li><li data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1772\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1772\">🧪 Dermatologically tested</p></li><li data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1812\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1812\">💯 Top Yuka scores (up to 100/100!)</p></li><li data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1889\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1889\">🤝 Full affiliate support: visuals, content &amp; tech info at your fingertips</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1966\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><br></p></div></div>",
